From bfaaba8dc9ccdb27590430adb45262d317e503e0 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: c4ffein <c4ffein.work@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 6 Jul 2026 12:03:09 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 5/8] Add 4 features in parallel: AI chat-assistant, MNIST
 tutorial, PyTorch codegen, tfjs 4 upgrade

Integrated from four independent subagent branches (each built on the theme-v0.1 base),
merged with a combined verification pass.

- AI chat-assistant bubble (src/lib/Assistant/*, src/components/Assistant/ChatBubble.vue):
  bottom-right chat with an actions API over D3Interface/KerasInterface (addLayer, listLayers,
  setParam, getModelSummary, generateCode, delete/undo/redo) exposed to Claude via an Anthropic
  tool-use client (bring-your-own-key from localStorage). 11 unit tests.
- MNIST tutorial mode (src/lib/Tutorial/mnistTutorial.js, src/components/Tutorial/TutorialOverlay.vue):
  8-step guided build with coachmark highlights that auto-advance on real editor state; "Tutorial"
  top-menu entry. 15 unit tests + tutorial.spec.js e2e.
- PyTorch code generation (src/lib/KerasInterface/KerasGeneratorPyTorchHelper.js): torch.nn.Module
  generation (LazyLinear/LazyConv2d), sequential + functional, unsupported layers -> explicit TODO;
  "Generate PyTorch" File-menu entry. 6 exact-string unit tests.
- @tensorflow/tfjs 3.3.0 -> 4.22.0: no code changes required (the v3 APIs in use are v4-compatible);
  builds against v4.

Merge notes: App.vue mounts both ChatBubble and TutorialOverlay; GeneralMenu.vue carries both the
PyTorch and Tutorial items (3-way merged).

Verified: lint 0/0, 60 unit tests (5 files), build ok on tfjs 4, e2e app/layer-help/tutorial 11/11
and non-network core-features 32/32. Not verifiable in this sandbox (network-blocked): live LLM chat
(needs an API key) and in-browser tfjs-4 training (needs a real browser + network).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>
